# Build context for apps/docker/Dockerfile is the repo root. Allowlist what the apps need, so a
# local build can't pick up .env files, venvs, or build outputs.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!python
!apps
!product-metadata
!products
!ingest_templates

**/.env
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.DS_Store
**/.lifecycle
**/.user.yml
**/target
**/dbt_packages
**/logs
**/node_modules
apps/*/ssl
